155 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (The probable design flaw is treating replication as if it were a complete, version-aware backup strategy, or using a backup process that does not maintain current versions and recovery points correctly. A stale replica or outdated backup can be restored if synchronization, backup scheduling, version selection, or recovery validation is inadequate.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
