190 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 46 0 R
/E (High availability and backup solve different problems. Replication helps keep data available when a storage node fails, whereas backup provides a recovery point that can be used to restore previous valid data. A robust recovery design therefore needs current, verified, versioned recovery points and a tested restoration process.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [27]
>>
